---
import stats from "../data/stats.json";
import { base } from "../lib/data";
---

<header class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-egg" role="img" aria-label="Um ovo de chocolate se abre e revela a cabeça de um político">
      <div class="egg-stage">
        <div class="face-layer">
          <div class="face-sway">
            <img class="face face-1" src={`${base}/animation/aecio_neves_cabeca.webp`} alt="" />
            <img class="face face-2" src={`${base}/animation/magno_malta_cabeca.webp`} alt="" />
            <img class="face face-3" src={`${base}/animation/ciro_nogueira_cabeca.webp`} alt="" />
            <img class="face face-4" src={`${base}/animation/eduardo_cunha_cabeca.webp`} alt="" />
          </div>
        </div>

        <img class="frame frame-1" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_1.webp`} alt="" />
        <img class="frame frame-2" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_2.webp`} alt="" />
        <img class="frame frame-2 frame-2-brown" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_2_brown.webp`} alt="" />
        <img class="frame frame-3" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_3.webp`} alt="" />
        <img class="frame frame-4 frame-4-left" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_4_esquerda.webp`} alt="" />
        <img class="frame frame-4 frame-4-right" src={`${base}/animation/kinder_ovo_4_direita.webp`} alt="" />
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-text">
      <h1 class="hero-title">Momento Kinder Ovo</h1>

      <p class="hero-dek">
        Desde 2018, ao fim de cada episódio do Foro de Teresina,
        a bancada escuta um áudio escolhido pela direção do programa e
        precisa adivinhar de quem é a voz surpresa. A gente contou e abriu todos esses ovos.
      </p>

      <p class="hero-count">
        São <strong>{stats.total}</strong> episódios, <strong>{stats.koDetected}</strong> ovos,
        <strong>{stats.winnersFound}</strong> acertos e <strong>{stats.figuresFound}</strong> vozes diferentes.
      </p>

      <p class="hero-byline">
        Um ensaio visual sobre o Foro de Teresina, por <a href="https://vitormafra.com">Vitor Mafra</a>
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: clamp(16px, 3vw, 32px) 0 0;
  }

  .hero-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .hero-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-egg {
    width: min(620px, 100%);
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 9vw, 5.75rem);
    line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    max-width: 10ch;
    margin-top: clamp(8px, 2vw, 24px);
  }

  .hero-dek,
  .hero-count {
    max-width: 33rem;
    font-size: clamp(1.1875rem, 1.6vw, 1.3125rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .hero-dek { margin-top: clamp(22px, 3vw, 32px); }
  /* os números em Caprasimo são mais largos: a frase ganha folga para caber em uma linha */
  .hero-count { margin-top: 0.8em; max-width: 38rem; text-wrap: balance; }

  .hero-count strong {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 1.12em;
    font-variant-numeric: lining-nums;
  }

  .hero-byline {
    margin-top: 24px;
    font-family: var(--font-ui);
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--ink-2);
  }

  .egg-stage {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1280 / 854;
    max-height: min(440px, 56vh);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .frame {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Stop-motion do ovo ----
     Ciclo de ~3,2s (1,6s abrindo + 1,6s fechando via `alternate`),
     ~400ms por quadro, cortes secos. */
  .frame-1 { animation: show-1 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate; }
  .frame-2 { animation: show-2 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate; }
  /* Cópia só da casca do quadro 2, por cima do rosto: a borda da casca
     cobre a cabeça e o interior claro fica atrás dela. */
  .frame-2-brown { z-index: 3; }
  .frame-3 { animation: show-3 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate; }
  .frame-4 { animation: show-4 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate; }
  .frame-4-left  { transform: translateX(-6%); }
  .frame-4-right { transform: translateX(6%); }

  @keyframes show-1 {
    0%   { opacity: 1; }
    25%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes show-2 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    25%  { opacity: 1; }
    50%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes show-3 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    50%  { opacity: 1; }
    75%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes show-4 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    75%  { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .face-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    z-index: 2;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(8%);
    animation: face-visibility 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes face-visibility {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    25%  { opacity: 1; }
  }

  .face-sway {
    position: relative;
    width: 76%;
    aspect-ratio: 1 / 1;
    transform-origin: 50% 50%;
    animation: sway 1.6s steps(1, end) infinite alternate;
  }

  @keyframes sway {
    0%   { transform: rotate(-12deg); }
    25%  { transform: rotate(10deg); }
    50%  { transform: rotate(-8deg); }
    75%  { transform: rotate(15deg); }
  }

  .face {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
    opacity: 0;
  }

  /* Um rosto por ciclo completo do ovo: 4 rostos × 3,2s = 12,8s. */
  .face-1 { animation: face-cycle-1 12.8s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  .face-2 { animation: face-cycle-2 12.8s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  .face-3 { animation: face-cycle-3 12.8s steps(1, end) infinite; }
  .face-4 { animation: face-cycle-4 12.8s steps(1, end) infinite; }

  @keyframes face-cycle-1 {
    0%   { opacity: 1; }
    25%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes face-cycle-2 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    25%  { opacity: 1; }
    50%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes face-cycle-3 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    50%  { opacity: 1; }
    75%  { opacity: 0; }
  }
  @keyframes face-cycle-4 {
    0%   { opacity: 0; }
    75%  { opacity: 1; }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .frame, .face-layer, .face-sway, .face { animation: none; }
    .frame-3 { opacity: 1; }
    .face-layer { opacity: 1; }
    .face-1 { opacity: 1; }
  }
</style>
